    {
      "uid": "zhcn:096963f8fdf29a622ad20c17",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我也很庆幸。那个人是您，\n我由衷地如此认为。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dfc030aba93b02051619ca70dfcc8cfd3603623a8cbd47a7acbb97600335d627",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111111.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        102,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/102/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fac9649155f812ae44633da7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不久前还是两个人。如今三个人，\n一同郑重地互相行礼。",
      "source_fingerprint": "38c760e9d77c5b4e614c02536e76bbf6f0ff6029d3a42780fde06d51844b8e46",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111111.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        11,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/11/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:70f034596219905c93019430",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "你，马上就要参加模拟赛了吧",
