    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5cb3accb906d918eba30782c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "随后，首先确认训练菜单。\n对空中救世主的安排，\n与前几天一样不变――",
      "source_fingerprint": "53725d1d77fb2ffae6f3b4187cf5779678adca37094265ecf7abae3f4b440266",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111111.json",
      "json_path": [
