    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:25e9216f20e9b3220d3dfcd8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "况且，对她而言这支队伍里还有世上\n独一无二的憧憬赛马娘可以拜师。会如此\n干劲十足也很正常――",
      "source_fingerprint": "7863bfc7e649b6055c74750828417366d561990db14be3463dee6839430a59e1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
